stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> queued: Port.submit
  queued --> working: _analyze starts
  working --> ready: gate ready
  working --> needs_review: gate needs_review
  working --> failed: _fail or resume ceiling
  working --> cancelled: cancel_meeting
  ready --> queued: reindex_meeting
  needs_review --> queued: reindex_meeting
  failed --> queued: new submit idempotency
  cancelled --> queued: new submit

  note right of working
    MAX_RESUMES=2 on interrupt
    reindex restores previous_status on stop
  end note
